Package: vabaxos-settings-copy
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, dconf-cli, network-manager, procps
Recommends: flatpak, packagekit-tools
Description: VabaxOS copy of settings: your VabaxOS in one file
 Saves voice and screen reader settings (Orca, speech-dispatcher), the
 desktop settings and keys, the Wi-Fi networks with their passwords and
 the list of programs you installed in one file, and puts them back on
 another computer or after a new installation, from a window Orca reads
 or from the terminal. A copy without Wi-Fi passwords is saved every day.
